# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 与 Android/Linux 协作时整文件 diff
# ⚠ 本文件由我方按跨平台惯例添加，若你另有约定可随时撤销
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# 语言统计
docs/* linguist-documentation
